OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GThe Santa Cecilia Orchestra and
OL,6,     GChorus perform Bach's magnificent
OL,7,     GMass in B minor at the
OL,8,     GAuditorium, Parco della Musica in
OL,9,     GRome.
OL,10,G0630FBreakfast
OL,11,     GTom McKinney presents Radio 3's
OL,12,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,13,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,14,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,15,     GIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,16,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,17,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,18,     Gwith familiar favourites.
