OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GExclusive music-making including
OL,6,     Ga live concert from the Ulster
OL,7,     GOrchestra, highlights from this
OL,8,     Gyears' Bath Mozartfest and music
OL,9,     Gfrom Freiburg Baroque Orchestra.
OL,10,G1600FComposer of the Week: Max Roach
OL,11,     GKate Molleson is joined by Kevin
OL,12,     GLeGendre to explore the life and
OL,13,     Gwork of drummer and composer Max
OL,14,     GRoach. Today exploring his
OL,15,     Gamazing percussion ensemble
OL,16,     GM'Boom.
